	(text "XT60 male on the board (PSU cable carries the female plug).\nMain fuse 25 A very fast, hand-soldered, not user-replaceable\n(last safety net, design 11 §3).\nSMBJ30CA bidirectional: does not conduct on reverse polarity.\nNo electrolytic here: it would see reverse polarity.\nBulk electrolytics sit on +24V_HEATER, after the cutoff."
